From 8cc137f350bf98fd5b1b1cd17f04e0caabbffdf3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:42:38 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(app): split the ahead-walk and digest out of rest.rs

rest.rs had grown to 424 lines, past AGENTS.md's ~400-line limit. The
walk over the operations ahead of a consumer (Ahead, path_hash,
ahead_of, digest_of) moves verbatim into rest/ahead.rs, visible only
to its parent; rest.rs keeps the laws, PriorState, PriorPlan and the
public API (prior_digest, prior_state, prior_plan, prior_stale)
unchanged. No behaviour change: rest.rs 245 lines, rest/ahead.rs 193.

Fixes #127

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/app/src/rest.rs       | 185 +--------------------------------
 crates/app/src/rest/ahead.rs | 193 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 196 insertions(+), 182 deletions(-)
